# Gradle local state. Nothing here is an artifact of the toolchain contract:
# the wrapper (gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle/wrapper/*) IS checked in and is a
# permanent Phase 0.1 deliverable.
.gradle/
build/
local.properties

# Phase 0.2 NDK cross-build output (artifacts, never checked in).
.native/

# JVM fatal-error and replay dumps. A forked test worker writes these into the
# module directory when it dies, so an adversarial mutant that crashes a JVM can
# leave hundreds of KiB behind. They are diagnostics, never inputs, and the
# shippable-inventory gate additionally FAILS if any survives a run.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Repository-local Gradle user home. Wrapper distributions, lock files and
# partial downloads land here; all of it is regenerated local state.
.gradle-user-home/
